<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said analyst Peter Rubicam initiated coverage of Cisco Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.05 per share for 1997, and $2.60 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target $85.  Shares dropped 1-3/4 to 65.</p>
</text>
